&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9f34bec01e263c55087324122f5edad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1d599469/uploads/origins/1b9be892-0302-4c93-858d-80a73f52bf6c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=608c1f95baf953a1658404a3a2ea4e59 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I would love for you to draw me and my wifes two catgirls, Sabrith and Tayelle! You can pick from any of their outfits. We would like something cute and fun, maybe with them on a date or adventure. Thank you!!\n\nhttp://imgur.com/a/auKCQ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Ryunosuke/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/83c30284/uploads/origins/d7268482-7606-40a0-9e09-c1b15697cd15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b006617042f846170ba7c1fa0fa84e0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/83c30284/uploads/origins/d7268482-7606-40a0-9e09-c1b15697cd15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b006617042f846170ba7c1fa0fa84e0, https://si.imgix.net/83c30284/uploads/origins/d7268482-7606-40a0-9e09-c1b15697cd15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c20fc83bbaac49aa55b88b7edd305443 2x, https://si.imgix.net/83c30284/uploads/origins/d7268482-7606-40a0-9e09-c1b15697cd15?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=577c0e1eee5e541a278bba04e7812ed9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, i would like to request three of my characters in one artwork, so i can use it as a background.\n\nPlease draw the background like a throne hall, maybe like in the Pose references, aslong it's more a bright and elegant environment.\n\"Nuxy\" should be on a throne like in \"Pose-01\".\nIn the orange marked area should be the character \"Nuxy\".\nIn the green marked area should be the character \"Chyrie\".\nIn the purple marked area should be the character \"Saiyu\", but on the other side on the ground (legs facing to the left)\n\"Nuxy\" can have a evil, smug or elegant expression, the other two just happy and calm.\n\nhttps://sta.sh/22dn11etvetp", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Ryunosuke/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6f093f9d/uploads/origins/936f2985-e747-4fb5-af39-9072b6c91242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0968e505bbee529390083b2497978715", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6f093f9d/uploads/origins/936f2985-e747-4fb5-af39-9072b6c91242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0968e505bbee529390083b2497978715, https://si.imgix.net/6f093f9d/uploads/origins/936f2985-e747-4fb5-af39-9072b6c91242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39e92c8691c8fec1b1a9e60dca9bf9ce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6f093f9d/uploads/origins/936f2985-e747-4fb5-af39-9072b6c91242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69338b908c03c384c25b7132344e4931 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、お会いできて嬉しいです!あなたのアートが本当に大好きです!\n\nあなたのスタイルで私のキャラクターのイラストをお願いしたいと思います！ https://imgur.com/a/fJwsYYb\n\n猫耳と前足をつけた姿を描いてください。\nhttps://imgur.com/zv9HrpA\n\nこのイラストのようなポーズをお願いしたいです。\nhttps://twitter.com/SuperPig2046/status/1270304746687979523?s=20\n\n可能であれば、キャラクターを別レイヤーにしたPSDを提供していただければ、透過的に使用することができますTwitterやYouTubeで画像を表示させたいです（配信サムネイル、アイコン、ヘッダーなど）!ありがとうございます!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/zv9HrpA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Ryunosuke/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d391b033/uploads/origins/0367f7cb-eafa-42fd-9717-d3108535879a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0353c2971b80c5aa4b2c24f755b042d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d391b033/uploads/origins/0367f7cb-eafa-42fd-9717-d3108535879a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0353c2971b80c5aa4b2c24f755b042d, https://si.imgix.net/d391b033/